<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This is a header-only library for LTP/BP/IDLE encapsulation packet defines. Encode and decode functions are in <ref refid="CcsdsEncapEncode_8h" kindref="compound">CcsdsEncapEncode.h</ref> and <ref refid="CcsdsEncapDecode_8h" kindref="compound">CcsdsEncapDecode.h</ref>, respectively. Based on: Encapsulation Packet Protocol: <ulink url="https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/133x1b3e1.pdf">https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/133x1b3e1.pdf</ulink> </para>
</sect1>
